# 
# The padlock has three wheels and they all start at six. The
# combination is 3-2-1: `tryToOpenGrate` compares the three against
# exactly that, and `adjustLockSettings` sounds the unlock the moment
# the last one lands. The top row of buttons turns a wheel up and the
# bottom row turns it down, so it is three down, four down, five down.
click 20 240
