# 
# The other half is the control panel on the basement door. Six
# buttons, and `panelButton` wants four of them down and two left
# alone: A1, A2, B2 and B3, not A3 or B1. Pressing a wrong one does
# not reset anything, it only keeps the check from passing.
click 323 304
pointer 2
pointer 3
pointer 6
pointer 7
# 
# Which is what the whole chapter walks towards. The closet opens only
# with the flag flying and the door worked loose, and behind it is
# Mandy. `goodbyeMandy`, and back to Roxy's house through the gazebo.
wait 120
click 532 241
